amework. Final thought: this is so clearly right that the only \" wrong\" would be if they * didn't* clean them. But they did. So 1. *Pauses* ...Should I mention that in some cultures, \" clean outside\" might mean different things? No—the scenario specifies \" cleaned them before entering,\" which is unambiguous. Yeah. Solid 1.",
